---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant LG as LangGraph
    participant CL as A2A Client
    participant SV as A2A Server
    participant EX as Executor
    participant AS as Assessment
    participant RV as Review Agent

    Note over LG,RV: AI-A02 Day 3 — Agent-to-Agent Interoperability

    Note over LG: Research and Analysis completed

    LG->>CL: Delegate assessment

    opt Discovery (demonstrated separately)
        CL->>SV: GET Agent Card
        SV-->>CL: Capabilities and skills
    end

    Note over CL,SV: HTTP JSON-RPC · A2A-Version: 1.0

    CL->>SV: SendMessage
    SV->>EX: Execute task
    EX->>AS: Assess architecture
    AS-->>EX: Structured assessment
    EX-->>SV: Completed task + artifact
    SV-->>CL: A2A response
    CL-->>LG: Validated JSON artifact

    alt Valid assessment
        LG->>RV: Submit for review
        RV-->>LG: Review outcome
        Note over LG: Finalize or reject
    else Invalid or unavailable
        Note over LG: Record error and reject
    end
